  "engine": "PostgreSQL Docker integration fixture",
  "contract": [
    "The uuid[] fixture contains two UUID values and SQL NULL; native pg_typeof, array_to_json and array_send provide independent type, semantic and wire-byte oracles.",
    "BookiE's valid quoted UUID array text is rebound through a typed cast and preserves native array JSON and array_send bytes even though PostgreSQL's uuid[]::text uses an unquoted spelling.",
    "The XLSX cell is a shared string and contains the complete 84-character array text without a formula.",
    "LibreOffice Calc opens XLSX and saves ODS, then reopens ODS and saves XLSX; exact cell text and string cell kinds remain unchanged."
